flowchart LR
    %% Traceability Chain — implementation authority:
    %% artifact_schema.py, task_graph.py, HARNESS.md, and harness-verify/SKILL.md

    REQ(["Requirement<br/>REQ-001 in spec.md<br/>## Requirements"]):::chain
    AC(["Acceptance Criterion<br/>AC-001 in spec.md<br/>## Acceptance Criteria"]):::chain
    TASK(["Task<br/>T-001 in tasks.md<br/>Covers: AC-*"]):::chain
    CODE[["Code Changes<br/>Project source + tests"]]:::code
    PROOF(["Validation Evidence / Proof<br/>task-done --evidence<br/>Validation evidence field in tasks.md"]):::chain
    REV(["Verdict in review.md<br/>alignment, design conformance,<br/>and security audit tables"]):::review
    SYNC(["## Post-Ship Sync<br/>session-extracts.md<br/>required before Done"]):::review

    REQ -->|resolves| AC
    AC -->|implements| TASK
    TASK -->|targets| CODE
    CODE -->|produces| PROOF
    PROOF -->|feeds| REV
    REV -->|validates| TASK
    REV -->|closeout record| SYNC

    REV -.->|orphan AC: linked in tasks but missing in spec| TASK
    REV -.->|unmapped AC: in spec without task linkage| AC
    REV -.->|unverified task: Done without proof| PROOF

    RULE["Traceability Rules:<br/>Skill procedure expresses requirements through ACs<br/>artifact-check --trace enforces AC ↔ T-NNN linkage<br/>Every Done T-NNN task requires validation evidence<br/>No orphan or unmapped ACs in harness-verify<br/>Done also requires review.md + ## Post-Ship Sync"]:::note

